[
  {
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 0.95,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "Welcome back to Trail Sessions.",
    "char_start": 15,
    "char_end": 46,
    "unit_id": "t0000.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0000.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 0.95,
    "end": 4.68,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "Today, we're talking about trail building, and I'm joined by Javier Benavides, a trail builder from the Cascadia Alliance.",
    "char_start": 47,
    "char_end": 169,
    "unit_id": "t0000.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0000.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 4.68,
    "end": 6.0,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "Javier Benavides, thank you for being here.",
    "char_start": 170,
    "char_end": 213,
    "unit_id": "t0000.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0000.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 6.0,
    "end": 7.07,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "Thank you, Lucía.",
    "char_start": 232,
    "char_end": 249,
    "unit_id": "t0001.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0001.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 7.07,
    "end": 12.0,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "With great enthusiasm – building trails is something I've thought about a lot.",
    "char_start": 250,
    "char_end": 328,
    "unit_id": "t0001.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0001.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 12.0,
    "end": 14.27,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "This episode is sponsored by Strava.",
    "char_start": 344,
    "char_end": 380,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 14.27,
    "end": 16.23,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "Strava is the home of athletes.",
    "char_start": 381,
    "char_end": 412,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 16.23,
    "end": 18.0,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "Start at strava.com/podcast.",
    "char_start": 413,
    "char_end": 441,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 18.0,
    "end": 20.96,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "Tell me about how you made that decision.",
    "char_start": 442,
    "char_end": 483,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 20.96,
    "end": 24.0,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "How does RockShox fit into this landscape?",
    "char_start": 484,
    "char_end": 526,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s05"
  },
  {
    "start": 24.0,
    "end": 26.48,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "Honestly, drainage is the design decision that has the biggest impact on any trail.",
    "char_start": 545,
    "char_end": 628,
    "unit_id": "t0003.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0003.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 26.48,
    "end": 28.15,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "We've seen this in teams that use the Cascadia Alliance.",
    "char_start": 629,
    "char_end": 685,
    "unit_id": "t0003.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0003.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 28.15,
    "end": 30.0,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 686,
    "char_end": 748,
    "unit_id": "t0003.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0003.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 30.0,
    "end": 32.27,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "Tell me how you made the decision.",
    "char_start": 764,
    "char_end": 798,
    "unit_id": "t0004.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0004.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 32.27,
    "end": 36.0,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "What is the version of the question that really matters?",
    "char_start": 799,
    "char_end": 855,
    "unit_id": "t0004.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0004.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 36.0,
    "end": 39.57,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "Yes, see – the most common mistake that new builders make is excavating with too much of a slope.",
    "char_start": 874,
    "char_end": 971,
    "unit_id": "t0005.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0005.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 39.57,
    "end": 42.0,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
    "char_start": 972,
    "char_end": 1038,
    "unit_id": "t0005.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0005.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 42.0,
    "end": 44.25,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
    "char_start": 1054,
    "char_end": 1087,
    "unit_id": "t0006.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0006.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 44.25,
    "end": 48.0,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "Where do soil erosion and trail construction intersect?",
    "char_start": 1088,
    "char_end": 1143,
    "unit_id": "t0006.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0006.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 48.0,
    "end": 48.14,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "Sure.",
    "char_start": 1162,
    "char_end": 1167,
    "unit_id": "t0007.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0007.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 48.14,
    "end": 50.36,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "Discussions about land management need to take place before the first excavation.",
    "char_start": 1168,
    "char_end": 1249,
    "unit_id": "t0007.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0007.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 50.36,
    "end": 51.84,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "We've seen this in teams that use RockShox components.",
    "char_start": 1250,
    "char_end": 1304,
    "unit_id": "t0007.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0007.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 51.84,
    "end": 54.0,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "The framework is important because it tells you what compromises you're making.",
    "char_start": 1305,
    "char_end": 1384,
    "unit_id": "t0007.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0007.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 54.0,
    "end": 60.0,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "Tell me more about that.",
    "char_start": 1400,
    "char_end": 1424,
    "unit_id": "t0008.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0008.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 60.0,
    "end": 66.0,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "And when teams adopt Spoke & Wrench within that workflow, the value becomes apparent. If you ignore that, you'll end up rebuilding it from scratch a year later.",
    "char_start": 1443,
    "char_end": 1603,
    "unit_id": "t0009.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0009.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 66.0,
    "end": 68.29,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "Tell me how you made the decision.",
    "char_start": 1619,
    "char_end": 1653,
    "unit_id": "t0010.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0010.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 68.29,
    "end": 72.0,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "Where do soil erosion and trail construction intersect?",
    "char_start": 1654,
    "char_end": 1709,
    "unit_id": "t0010.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0010.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 72.0,
    "end": 72.16,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "Sure.",
    "char_start": 1728,
    "char_end": 1733,
    "unit_id": "t0011.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0011.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 72.16,
    "end": 73.68,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "Cuts in the bank on the slopes are not optional.",
    "char_start": 1734,
    "char_end": 1782,
    "unit_id": "t0011.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0011.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 73.68,
    "end": 75.75,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "The shortcut of the first day is the landslide of the third year.",
    "char_start": 1783,
    "char_end": 1848,
    "unit_id": "t0011.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0011.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 75.75,
    "end": 78.0,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
    "char_start": 1849,
    "char_end": 1920,
    "unit_id": "t0011.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0011.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 78.0,
    "end": 79.93,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "That's a useful framework.",
    "char_start": 1936,
    "char_end": 1962,
    "unit_id": "t0012.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0012.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 79.93,
    "end": 84.0,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "What is the version of the question that truly matters?",
    "char_start": 1963,
    "char_end": 2018,
    "unit_id": "t0012.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0012.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 84.0,
    "end": 86.34,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "Yes, look – the structure of the soil matters more than people realize.",
    "char_start": 2037,
    "char_end": 2108,
    "unit_id": "t0013.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0013.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 86.34,
    "end": 87.96,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "We've seen this in teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
    "char_start": 2109,
    "char_end": 2158,
    "unit_id": "t0013.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0013.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 87.96,
    "end": 90.0,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 2159,
    "char_end": 2221,
    "unit_id": "t0013.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0013.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 90.0,
    "end": 92.04,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "What does the failure mode look like?",
    "char_start": 2237,
    "char_end": 2274,
    "unit_id": "t0014.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0014.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 92.04,
    "end": 96.0,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "What is the structural aspect that most listeners do not have access to?",
    "char_start": 2275,
    "char_end": 2347,
    "unit_id": "t0014.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0014.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 96.0,
    "end": 97.77,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "Let me give you the version that I truly believe in.",
    "char_start": 2366,
    "char_end": 2418,
    "unit_id": "t0015.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0015.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 97.77,
    "end": 99.89,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "I've changed my mind about machine-made versus handmade items.",
    "char_start": 2419,
    "char_end": 2481,
    "unit_id": "t0015.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0015.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 99.89,
    "end": 102.0,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 2482,
    "char_end": 2544,
    "unit_id": "t0015.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0015.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 102.0,
    "end": 108.0,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "Tell me more about that.",
    "char_start": 2560,
    "char_end": 2584,
    "unit_id": "t0016.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0016.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 108.0,
    "end": 114.0,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "And when teams adopt the Cascadia Alliance within that workflow, the progress becomes visible. If you ignore that, you end up having to rebuild it from scratch a year later.",
    "char_start": 2603,
    "char_end": 2776,
    "unit_id": "t0017.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0017.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 114.0,
    "end": 120.0,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "We'll be right back after a short commercial break.",
    "char_start": 2792,
    "char_end": 2843,
    "unit_id": "t0018.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0018.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 120.0,
    "end": 121.48,
    "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_02",
    "text": "Today's episode is brought to you by Stripe.",
    "char_start": 2856,
    "char_end": 2900,
    "unit_id": "t0019.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0019.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 121.48,
    "end": 124.58,
    "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_02",
    "text": "Stripe simplifies payments, whether you're running a marketplace or a subscription business.",
    "char_start": 2901,
    "char_end": 2993,
    "unit_id": "t0019.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0019.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 124.58,
    "end": 126.0,
    "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_02",
    "text": "Visit stripe.com/podcast for a free trial.",
    "char_start": 2994,
    "char_end": 3036,
    "unit_id": "t0019.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0019.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 126.0,
    "end": 129.13,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "Welcome back to the program. How does the failure mode look?",
    "char_start": 3052,
    "char_end": 3112,
    "unit_id": "t0020.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0020.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 129.13,
    "end": 132.0,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "Where do soil erosion and trail construction intersect?",
    "char_start": 3113,
    "char_end": 3168,
    "unit_id": "t0020.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0020.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 132.0,
    "end": 132.53,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "That's how I see it.",
    "char_start": 3187,
    "char_end": 3207,
    "unit_id": "t0021.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0021.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 132.53,
    "end": 134.48,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "Drainage is the design decision that has the biggest impact on any trail.",
    "char_start": 3208,
    "char_end": 3281,
    "unit_id": "t0021.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0021.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 134.48,
    "end": 136.03,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "We've seen it with equipment that uses Shimano components.",
    "char_start": 3282,
    "char_end": 3340,
    "unit_id": "t0021.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0021.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 136.03,
    "end": 138.0,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "If you ignore that, you'll end up rebuilding it from scratch a year later.",
    "char_start": 3341,
    "char_end": 3415,
    "unit_id": "t0021.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0021.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 138.0,
    "end": 140.68,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "Tell me how you made the decision.",
    "char_start": 3431,
    "char_end": 3465,
    "unit_id": "t0022.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0022.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 140.68,
    "end": 144.0,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "How does RockShox fit into this landscape?",
    "char_start": 3466,
    "char_end": 3508,
    "unit_id": "t0022.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0022.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 144.0,
    "end": 147.57,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "Yes, see – the most common mistake that new builders make is excavating with too much of a slope.",
    "char_start": 3527,
    "char_end": 3624,
    "unit_id": "t0023.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0023.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 147.57,
    "end": 150.0,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
    "char_start": 3625,
    "char_end": 3691,
    "unit_id": "t0023.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0023.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 150.0,
    "end": 151.72,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "Challenge my conventional wisdom.",
    "char_start": 3707,
    "char_end": 3740,
    "unit_id": "t0024.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0024.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 151.72,
    "end": 156.0,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "What is something you used to believe about this that you have since re-evaluated?",
    "char_start": 3741,
    "char_end": 3823,
    "unit_id": "t0024.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0024.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 156.0,
    "end": 157.3,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "Let me give you the version that I truly believe in.",
    "char_start": 3842,
    "char_end": 3894,
    "unit_id": "t0025.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0025.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 157.3,
    "end": 159.23,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "Discussions about land management need to happen before the first excavation.",
    "char_start": 3895,
    "char_end": 3972,
    "unit_id": "t0025.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0025.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 159.23,
    "end": 160.45,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "We've seen this in teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
    "char_start": 3973,
    "char_end": 4022,
    "unit_id": "t0025.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0025.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 160.45,
    "end": 162.0,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 4023,
    "char_end": 4085,
    "unit_id": "t0025.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0025.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 162.0,
    "end": 168.0,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "That makes sense.",
    "char_start": 4101,
    "char_end": 4118,
    "unit_id": "t0026.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0026.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 168.0,
    "end": 171.62,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "Outside of the tools available at the Cascadia Alliance level, the failure mode is more difficult to detect.",
    "char_start": 4137,
    "char_end": 4245,
    "unit_id": "t0027.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0027.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 171.62,
    "end": 174.0,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
    "char_start": 4246,
    "char_end": 4317,
    "unit_id": "t0027.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0027.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 174.0,
    "end": 176.89,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "What is the heuristic that you always fall back on?",
    "char_start": 4333,
    "char_end": 4384,
    "unit_id": "t0028.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0028.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 176.89,
    "end": 180.0,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "What is the version of the question that truly matters?",
    "char_start": 4385,
    "char_end": 4440,
    "unit_id": "t0028.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0028.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 180.0,
    "end": 182.1,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "It boils down to this: cuts in banking on the slopes are not optional.",
    "char_start": 4459,
    "char_end": 4529,
    "unit_id": "t0029.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0029.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 182.1,
    "end": 184.08,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "The shortcut of the first year is the landslide of the third year.",
    "char_start": 4530,
    "char_end": 4596,
    "unit_id": "t0029.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0029.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 184.08,
    "end": 186.0,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "I have seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 4597,
    "char_end": 4661,
    "unit_id": "t0029.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0029.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 186.0,
    "end": 188.19,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "What does a failure mode look like?",
    "char_start": 4677,
    "char_end": 4712,
    "unit_id": "t0030.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0030.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 188.19,
    "end": 192.0,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of trail construction?",
    "char_start": 4713,
    "char_end": 4774,
    "unit_id": "t0030.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0030.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 192.0,
    "end": 193.4,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "Let me give you the version that I truly believe in.",
    "char_start": 4793,
    "char_end": 4845,
    "unit_id": "t0031.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0031.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 193.4,
    "end": 194.83,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "Soil structure is more important than people realize.",
    "char_start": 4846,
    "char_end": 4899,
    "unit_id": "t0031.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0031.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 194.83,
    "end": 196.33,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "We've seen this in teams that use the Cascadia Alliance.",
    "char_start": 4900,
    "char_end": 4956,
    "unit_id": "t0031.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0031.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 196.33,
    "end": 198.0,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 4957,
    "char_end": 5019,
    "unit_id": "t0031.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0031.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 198.0,
    "end": 200.68,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
    "char_start": 5035,
    "char_end": 5068,
    "unit_id": "t0032.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0032.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 200.68,
    "end": 204.0,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "How does Shimano fit into this landscape?",
    "char_start": 5069,
    "char_end": 5110,
    "unit_id": "t0032.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0032.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 204.0,
    "end": 207.31,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "Yes, look – I've changed my mind about machine-made trails versus hand-made ones.",
    "char_start": 5129,
    "char_end": 5210,
    "unit_id": "t0033.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0033.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 207.31,
    "end": 210.0,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
    "char_start": 5211,
    "char_end": 5277,
    "unit_id": "t0033.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0033.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 210.0,
    "end": 216.0,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "Where does that stop working?",
    "char_start": 5293,
    "char_end": 5322,
    "unit_id": "t0034.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0034.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 216.0,
    "end": 219.43,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "Outside of the RockShox suspension system, the failure mode is more difficult to detect.",
    "char_start": 5341,
    "char_end": 5429,
    "unit_id": "t0035.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0035.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 219.43,
    "end": 222.0,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
    "char_start": 5430,
    "char_end": 5496,
    "unit_id": "t0035.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0035.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 222.0,
    "end": 228.0,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "Let's change the subject – I want to dedicate the final part to land management.",
    "char_start": 5512,
    "char_end": 5592,
    "unit_id": "t0036.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0036.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 228.0,
    "end": 234.0,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "That's where the conversation gets interesting, because the concessions regarding land management permeate everything we've discussed.",
    "char_start": 5611,
    "char_end": 5745,
    "unit_id": "t0037.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0037.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 234.0,
    "end": 235.85,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
    "char_start": 5761,
    "char_end": 5794,
    "unit_id": "t0038.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0038.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 235.85,
    "end": 240.0,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "What is the opposing perspective that most listeners don't have access to?",
    "char_start": 5795,
    "char_end": 5869,
    "unit_id": "t0038.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0038.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 240.0,
    "end": 242.44,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "It boils down to this: drainage is the design decision that has the biggest impact on any trail.",
    "char_start": 5888,
    "char_end": 5984,
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0039.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 242.44,
    "end": 244.12,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "We've seen it happen with equipment that uses RockShox components.",
    "char_start": 5985,
    "char_end": 6051,
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0039.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 244.12,
    "end": 246.0,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "If you ignore that, you'll end up rebuilding it from scratch a year later.",
    "char_start": 6052,
    "char_end": 6126,
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0039.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 246.0,
    "end": 248.19,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "What does a failure mode look like?",
    "char_start": 6142,
    "char_end": 6177,
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0040.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 248.19,
    "end": 252.0,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of trail construction?",
    "char_start": 6178,
    "char_end": 6239,
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0040.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 252.0,
    "end": 255.27,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "Honestly, the most common mistake that new builders make is excavating with too much of a slope.",
    "char_start": 6258,
    "char_end": 6354,
    "unit_id": "t0041.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0041.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 255.27,
    "end": 258.0,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "The framework is important because it tells you what compromises you are making.",
    "char_start": 6355,
    "char_end": 6435,
    "unit_id": "t0041.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0041.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 258.0,
    "end": 264.0,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "Before we wrap up, what's one thing that listeners can try out this week?",
    "char_start": 6451,
    "char_end": 6524,
    "unit_id": "t0042.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0042.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 264.0,
    "end": 268.21,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "Choose one of the ideas we discussed and implement it for two weeks.",
    "char_start": 6543,
    "char_end": 6611,
    "unit_id": "t0043.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0043.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 268.21,
    "end": 270.0,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "Everything else is iteration.",
    "char_start": 6612,
    "char_end": 6641,
    "unit_id": "t0043.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0043.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 270.0,
    "end": 272.0,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "And finally, a big thank you to our partners at Linear.",
    "char_start": 6657,
    "char_end": 6712,
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0044.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 272.0,
    "end": 275.02,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "Linear is the incident management tool built for speed – designed for the keyboard.",
    "char_start": 6713,
    "char_end": 6796,
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0044.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 275.02,
    "end": 276.0,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "Check it out at linear.com.",
    "char_start": 6797,
    "char_end": 6824,
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0044.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 276.0,
    "end": 282.0,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "Javier Benavides, thank you for the conversation.",
    "char_start": 6825,
    "char_end": 6874,
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0044.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 282.0,
    "end": 288.0,
    "speaker_label": "Javier Benavides",
    "text": "Thank you, Lucía.",
    "char_start": 6893,
    "char_end": 6910,
    "unit_id": "t0045.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0045.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 288.0,
    "end": 292.39,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "That's all for today's episode of Trail Sessions.",
    "char_start": 6926,
    "char_end": 6975,
    "unit_id": "t0046.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0046.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 292.39,
    "end": 294.0,
    "speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
    "text": "See you next time.",
    "char_start": 6976,
    "char_end": 6994,
    "unit_id": "t0046.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0046.s02"
  }
]
